{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3062","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3062","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3062\",\"parent_revision\":\"102440addc9a419a63baa60a413099cc9290783896aaa5a06f9d270b240745d5\",\"root_revision\":\"102440addc9a419a63baa60a413099cc9290783896aaa5a06f9d270b240745d5\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nPagination has no content identity. Page structures carry a page number and total, but nothing identifying which document they page. Across stateless invocations a caller cannot request \\\"the next page of what you just returned\\\" \u2014 every page request re-collects from the provider and re-parses.\\n\\nThis is also a correctness gap: if content changes between page requests, pages from two different versions can be returned as though they were one document.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] A paginated response returns a stable identifier derived from the content it paginates\\n- [ ] A later page is requested with that identifier plus a page selector or address\\n- [ ] Serving a later page does not re-collect from the provider and does not re-parse\\n- [ ] A request whose identifier no longer matches current content is reported stale, not served\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- Intended behaviour is defined in `plugins/development-harness/docs/agent-markdown-consumption-contract.md`. Component ownership is defined in `plugins/development-harness/docs/component-architecture.md`. Parent: #3054.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Open Decisions\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nCache scope (session-lived or persisted) and whether the identifier derives from raw markdown or the parsed tree are recorded as open questions in the contract.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"58e2585568b6129bcf72f38c0e88208251fa4063e0a8746c1c2d89ebb18a0245\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPvbsYw\"}"}